{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimensionNotCategorical","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimensionNotCategorical","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Multiset.Bind","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.IntervalCases"],"declarations":17,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.one_not_mem_dims_cube","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.one_not_mem_dims_cube","kind":"theorem","line":186,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FibreFunctorDimensionNotCategorical.lean#L186-L192","doc":"Restated for the eightfold multiset: `1 ∉ dims(V^{⊗3})` for every `n ≥ 2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.no_one_dimensional_summand_of_cube","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.no_one_dimensional_summand_of_cube","kind":"theorem","line":172,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FibreFunctorDimensionNotCategorical.lean#L172-L184","doc":"**The theorem.**  Under a fibre functor of any dimension `n ≥ 2`, no summand\nof `V^{⊗3}` is one-dimensional.  The eightfold decomposition\n`𝟏𝟎 ⊕ 𝟖 ⊕ 𝟖 ⊕ 𝟏` therefore cannot be the image of `V^{⊗3}` under any fibre\nfunctor of the single-fibre category: changing `τ'` changes `n`, and only `n`.\nThe obstruction is the fusion rule (the parity invariant above), which is a\nproperty of the category. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.dimSeq_succ_ge_n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.dimSeq_succ_ge_n","kind":"theorem","line":165,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FibreFunctorDimensionNotCategorical.lean#L165-L170","doc":"Every summand of positive spin has dimension at least `n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.dimSeq_ge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.dimSeq_ge","kind":"theorem","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FibreFunctorDimensionNotCategorical.lean#L149-L163","doc":"For `n ≥ 2` the dimension sequence is positive and non-decreasing. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.dimSeq_three_ne_eight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.dimSeq_three_ne_eight","kind":"theorem","line":136,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FibreFunctorDimensionNotCategorical.lean#L136-L147","doc":"No fibre functor gives `V_{3/2}` the octet dimension `8` either. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.dimSeq_three_ne_ten","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.dimSeq_three_ne_ten","kind":"theorem","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FibreFunctorDimensionNotCategorical.lean#L123-L134","doc":"No fibre functor gives `V_{3/2}` the decuplet dimension `10`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.dims_cube_at_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.dims_cube_at_three","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FibreFunctorDimensionNotCategorical.lean#L117-L121","doc":"Under a **three**-dimensional fibre functor `V^{⊗3}` has dimensions\n`{21, 3, 3}` — the same total `27` as `10 + 8 + 8 + 1`, a different split. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.cube_total","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.cube_total","kind":"theorem","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FibreFunctorDimensionNotCategorical.lean#L113-L115","doc":"The dimensions of the three summands of `V^{⊗3}` add up to `n³`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.dimSeq_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.dimSeq_three","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FibreFunctorDimensionNotCategorical.lean#L109-L111","doc":"`dim τ'(V_{3/2}) = n³ − 2n`: `4` at `n = 2`, `21` at `n = 3`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.dimSeq_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.dimSeq_two","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FibreFunctorDimensionNotCategorical.lean#L106-L107","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.dimSeq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.dimSeq_one","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FibreFunctorDimensionNotCategorical.lean#L105-L105","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.dimSeq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.dimSeq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FibreFunctorDimensionNotCategorical.lean#L104-L104","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.dimSeq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.dimSeq","kind":"def","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FibreFunctorDimensionNotCategorical.lean#L97-L102","doc":"Dimensions `d_{k/2} = dim τ'(V_{k/2})` under a fibre functor with\n`dim τ'(V) = n`, by monoidality applied to the Clebsch–Gordan rule. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.zero_not_mem_cgSpins_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.zero_not_mem_cgSpins_three","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FibreFunctorDimensionNotCategorical.lean#L89-L95","doc":"The spin-`0` object (the only one-dimensional simple) does not occur in\n`V^{⊗3}`.  This is the categorical form of \"`Λ³V = 0`\": the singlet the\neightfold way needs is absent, under every fibre functor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.cgSpins_parity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.cgSpins_parity","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FibreFunctorDimensionNotCategorical.lean#L68-L87","doc":"Parity invariant: every summand of `V^{⊗k}` has `2j ≡ k (mod 2)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.cgSpins_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.cgSpins_three","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FibreFunctorDimensionNotCategorical.lean#L65-L66","doc":"`V^{⊗3} ≅ V_{3/2} ⊕ V_{1/2} ⊕ V_{1/2}`: twice-spins `{3, 1, 1}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.cgSpins","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Eightfold.FibreFunctorDimension.cgSpins","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Eightfold/FibreFunctorDimensionNotCategorical.lean#L58-L63","doc":"Twice-spins `2j` of the simple summands of `V^{⊗k}` in `Rep(SL_q(2))`,\nwith multiplicity, by the Clebsch–Gordan rule `V ⊗ V_j ≅ V_{j+1/2} ⊕ V_{j−1/2}`\n(`V ⊗ V_0 ≅ V_{1/2}`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}